WHAT I AM HAPPY WITH THAT IS WORKING:
==============================================
 
1. The Fetch API successfully loads the states dropdown from
   the external states.html file on page load.
 
2. The cookie correctly identifies returning users and shows
   a personalized welcome message in the sticky header.
 
3. The "Not [name]?" checkbox properly expires the cookie and
   clears all local storage, resetting the form completely.
 
4. Local storage saves each field as the user types and reloads
   all the data automatically when a returning user is detected.
 
5. The sticky header stays visible as the user scrolls down,
   and the fixed footer stays at the bottom of the screen at
   all times.
 
6. The Remember Me checkbox controls whether the cookie and
   local storage are saved or cleared on validate/reset.
 
7. All homework 3 validation still works on the fly.
 
